Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty/commit/1a9edb0009a7e4fd87d2eca5d61386ce0c2b7e9d]

Install Ghostty's signal handlers before anything can notify systemd, and
skip systemd reload notifications for config reloads during startup.

systemd 262 refuses to start a Type=notify-reload service whose reload
signal has no handler when it reports READY=1. Syncing the dark color
scheme at startup reloads the config and reported READY=1 before the
SIGUSR2 handler existed, so D-Bus activation of
app-com.mitchellh.ghostty.service failed intermittently and no window
opened.

Upstream fix: https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty/pull/14399
Drop when Ghostty is updated to 1.4.0 or later.

